<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 49-1 AT TEA V PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND 49-1 AT TEA V PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>LAHORE, Pakistan 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were 49 for one in their second innings at tea on the second day of the first test against Pakistan on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: New Zealand 155 and 49-1; Pakistan 191.</p>
</text>
